    "created_at": "2017-06-28T22:02:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-06-28T22:02:09Z",
    "body": "Okay, so the problem is that we don't make a distinction between synthetic and non-synthetic at creation. So unless we explicitly pass a time in all places that define that the user agent is to dispatch an event, we end up introducing a regression of sorts.",
